# System overview (nwk1 / apollo / athena / artemis)

Live inspection 2026-08-30 via `ssh nwk1` and `ssh apollo`. Local rsync mirrors: `projects/nwk1/system.bbimarketing.com`, `projects/apollo`. Related: `01-api-contracts.mdc`, `02-etl-state-machine.mdc`, `03-database-schema.mdc`, `04-file-storage-accuzip.mdc`, `05-modernization-mapping.mdc`.

When changing ETL or APIs, verify the other side of the call (`nwk1` ↔ `apollo` ↔ `athena`) and whether `projects/bbi-sst` already replaced that path.

