## Network routing

```
GLS / Domino's  10.x / 100.x :59101  (NTLM HTTP PulseWeb)
        ^
        | OpenConnect tun0 on apollo
        |
Tampa LAN 192.168.4.0/24
  gateway 192.168.4.1  WAN gateway.bbimarketing.com = 47.198.214.106
  apollo .26  <->  athena .24   (internal HTTPS)
  artemis .25  accuzip-vm .30  render-vm .29
        ^
        | WireGuard 10.14.0.0  (nwk1 = 10.14.0.100)
        |
nwk1 198.74.60.204
  /etc/hosts: 192.168.4.26 vpn.bbimarketing.com
```

| Name | Resolves / used as |
|---|---|
| `system.bbimarketing.com` | nwk1 public HTTPS (Let’s Encrypt) |
| `nwk1.nj.bbimarketing.com` | nwk1 hostname |
| `vpn.bbimarketing.com` | Cloudflare → office WAN → apollo `:443`. nwk1 hosts file pins LAN IP when on WireGuard. |
| `upload.bbimarketing.com` | nwk1 vhost **and** Cloudflare Worker proxy to SST `POST /upload` (`projects/bbi-tf/workers/upload-proxy.js`) |
| `gateway.bbimarketing.com` | Office WAN `47.198.214.106` |

Pulse store queries: `http://{vpn_ip_address}:59101/PulseWeb/{EOutbox\|EArchive}/` with `CURLAUTH_NTLM` (`projects/apollo/services/pulse_fetch/core/functions.inc` ~28, 36–43, 263). Traffic leaves apollo on `tun0`. GOST (`gost-socks.service`, listen `192.168.4.26:1080`) is a SOCKS5 helper for operators who are **not** on GLS; PHP pollers do not use it.

## Nginx (live)

**nwk1** `/etc/nginx/nginx.conf`: `client_max_body_size 100M`; default servers return `444`; `include sites-enabled/*`.

`system.bbimarketing.com` (`/etc/nginx/sites-available/system.bbimarketing.com`):

- HTTP → `301` HTTPS
- `root /var/www/system.bbimarketing.com`; `location ~ \.php$` → `snippets/fastcgi-php.conf` → **php5.6-fpm**
- `/new/min/` minify rewrite; `/new/api/v2/` `try_files` + `fastcgi_param HTTP_AUTHORIZATION`
- deny `.pem|.key|.inc|.json` (`444`)

`upload.bbimarketing.com`: TLS 1.3; `root /var/www/upload.bbimarketing.com`; `/dominos-uploaded/` denied.

**apollo** `/etc/nginx/nginx.conf`: `client_max_body_size 50M`. HTTP `:80` serves `/api/` and `/api/accuzip/` on php5-fpm (`fastcgi_read_timeout 1800s`); other HTTP → HTTPS. HTTPS `:443` cert `vpn.bbimarketing.com`; `root /var/www`; `.inc` → `444`.

